baseline: startpos alone answers perft 1 = 20 when the FEN is refused

| case | message | perft 1 | reading |
|---|---|---|---|
| 3000-char first field | info string invalid FEN: invalid FEN placement | 20 | REFUSED, startpos kept |
| 1500 ranks | info string invalid FEN: invalid FEN rank | 20 | REFUSED, startpos kept |
| 70 ranks | info string invalid FEN: invalid FEN rank | 20 | REFUSED, startpos kept |
| 64-digit rank | info string invalid FEN: too many squares in FEN ran | 20 | REFUSED, startpos kept |
| CONTROL valid startpos | - | 20 | accepted |
